WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:03.050
Unit six. Shopping!

2
00:00:03.968 --> 00:00:11.991
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Chanthy. Welcome to C2-EPE Master English, Beginner level!

3
00:00:12.041 --> 00:00:15.557
Hi, Teacher Chanthy! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:15.607 --> 00:00:19.173
Today we learn: Shopping. Let's go!

5
00:00:20.841 --> 00:00:24.708
Store. Say it with me. Store!

6
00:00:28.199 --> 00:00:31.765
Price. Say it with me. Price!

7
00:00:35.266 --> 00:00:39.183
Cashier. Say it with me. Cashier!

8
00:00:42.687 --> 00:00:46.454
Receipt. Say it with me. Receipt!

9
00:00:49.951 --> 00:00:53.868
Discount. Say it with me. Discount!

10
00:00:57.348 --> 00:01:01.014
Try on. Say it with me. Try on!

11
00:01:04.516 --> 00:01:08.550
Size. Say it with me. Size!

12
00:01:12.065 --> 00:01:15.132
Pay. Say it with me. Pay!

13
00:01:18.637 --> 00:01:22.104
Bargain. Say it with me. Bargain!

14
00:01:25.596 --> 00:01:29.829
Shopping bag. Say it with me. Shopping bag!

15
00:01:33.332 --> 00:01:44.055
Grammar time! Past simple narrative. Listen. I went to the store. I paid with cash.

16
00:01:44.105 --> 00:01:50.519
Your turn. Say it with me. I went to the store. I paid with cash.

17
00:01:54.979 --> 00:02:01.743
I went to the store to try on some clothes. The cashier gave me a discount and a receipt after I paid.

18
00:02:01.793 --> 00:02:03.228
I like this story!

19
00:02:04.332 --> 00:02:09.584
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:09.634 --> 00:02:10.784
Cashier!

21
00:02:11.853 --> 00:02:17.087
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:17.137 --> 00:02:18.287
Size!

23
00:02:19.241 --> 00:02:27.222
Think and answer. Describe your last shopping trip.

24
00:02:27.272 --> 00:02:28.478
Great answer!

25
00:02:29.613 --> 00:02:34.114
Great work today! See you next time. Goodbye!

26
00:02:34.164 --> 00:02:35.779
Goodbye, everyone!

